  "descriptions": [
    {
      "text": "Paul Atreides arrives on the desert planet Arrakis with a family entrusted with governing a valuable and contested territory. Control of its spice brings competing powers into conflict, while the harsh environment makes survival a struggle of its own. As his family’s position becomes dangerous, Paul must understand the people and forces around him. The novel connects his choices with wider questions about power, belief and scarce resources.",
